# The old web/ level: nothing is tracked there now. A clone made before the move still holds its ignored data under
# it (node_modules, socomlegacy/public/maps, socomlegacy/test-fixtures) until it moves them (workflow/setup.sh
# prints the commands); this keeps all of it out of `git status` and out of a commit meanwhile.
/web/

