/socomlegacy/logs/
# The playtest sessions' records and evidence (socomlegacy/packages/playtest, spec 4.4): local, never committed
/socomlegacy/.playtest/
# The local stack's data (socomlegacy/tools/local-stack.ts, issue #100): its accounts and, for --split, the node key
/socomlegacy/.local-stack/
